*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0041
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 867
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0041.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0041C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 EXTRA-TXN-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-COUNT-FEE
    PERFORM HIGH-VOLUME-FEE
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-TXN-FEE=" EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    STOP RUN.
3000-COUNT-FEE.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF MONTHLY-TXNS > 25
        COMPUTE EXTRA-TXN-FEE = (MONTHLY-TXNS - 25) * 0.75
    END-IF.
HIGH-VOLUME-FEE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'B'
       AND MONTHLY-TXNS > 45
        ADD 10 TO EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    END-IF.
